---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use - Haepapa">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Terms of Use</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-light-grey dark:text-dark-grey mb-6">
        Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}
      </p>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">2. Use License</h2>
        <p>
          You are free to view and explore the content on this website for personal, educational, or informational purposes. Individual projects may have their own licenses as specified in their respective GitHub repositories.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">3. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          This website is a portfolio showcasing personal projects and experiments. All content is provided "as is" for informational purposes. We make no warranties about the completeness, reliability, or accuracy of the information presented. Any reliance you place on such information is strictly at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">4. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website contains links to external repositories and resources (such as GitHub). We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of external sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">5. Content Updates</h2>
        <p>
          We may update, modify, or remove content at any time without notice. Project statuses, descriptions, and technical details reflect our work at the time of writing and may change as projects evolve.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms, you can reach us through our GitHub repository at <a href="https://github.com/haepapa/haepapacom" class="text-light-main dark:text-dark-main underline hover:no-underline">github.com/haepapa/haepapacom</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
